---
import PageLayout from "blume/components/layout/PageLayout.astro";
import data from "blume:data";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
const { config } = data;
---
<PageLayout site={{ title: config.title, description: config.description }} logo={{ ...config.logo, dimensions: { light: { width: 1280, height: 1280 }, dark: { width: 1280, height: 1280 } } }} navigation={data.navigation} favicon={config.favicon} fontCssVars={data.fontCssVars} themeMode={config.theme.mode} searchEnabled={config.search.enabled} siteUrl={config.site} ogEnabled={config.og.enabled} page={{ title: "openlaunch — Connect your agents to your hardware", description: config.description }}>
<main class="workbench">
  <section class="intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE · MIT LICENSED</p>
    <h1>Connect your agents<br />to your hardware.</h1>
    <p class="intro-copy">Expose the functions your devices can perform.<br class="desktop-break" /> Choose what each agent may use. Follow every action to a result.</p>
    <nav class="hero-actions" aria-label="Get started"><a class="primary-link" href="/console/">Open console <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a href="/docs/setup">Read the setup guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></nav>
    <p class="intro-note">Free to use. Self-hostable. One public codebase. <a href="/pricing">See pricing →</a></p>
  </section>
  <section class="workflow" aria-label="How openlaunch works">
    <article><span class="step">01</span><h2>Connect a device</h2><p>Run an adapter on your Pi or pair an Uno. A setup token attaches the device; it does not give an agent control.</p></article>
    <article><span class="step">02</span><h2>Grant specific functions</h2><p>Connect an agent separately. Choose its devices, functions and access duration. Revoke access from your console.</p></article>
    <article><span class="step">03</span><h2>Inspect the receipt</h2><p>Follow a command from request to result. A queued action is pending; a reported result is evidence from the adapter.</p></article>
  </section>
  <section class="hardware-section" aria-labelledby="hardware-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">START WITH YOUR HARDWARE</p><h2 id="hardware-title">A board. A computer.<br />Or something you build.</h2></div><a href="/docs/status">Hardware verification →</a></div>
    <div class="boards">
      <article><a class="board-image" href="/docs/uno-r4"><img src="/images/uno-r4-wifi.webp" alt="Generated monochrome illustration of an Uno R4 WiFi board" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></a><h3>Uno R4 WiFi</h3><p>Read health, control the built-in LED and write ASCII matrix text. Stock and repaired console-mux profiles use separate builds.</p><a href="/docs/uno-r4">Set up your Uno →</a></article>
      <article><a class="board-image" href="/docs/pi"><img src="/images/raspberry-pi-4.webp" alt="Generated monochrome illustration of a Raspberry Pi 4 Model B" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /></a><h3>Raspberry Pi 4</h3><p>Use the Go device adapter for health, or the Linux host adapter for explicitly enabled host functions. Start with the target acceptance checklist.</p><a href="/docs/pi">Set up your Pi →</a></article>
    </div>
    <p class="image-note">Generated illustrations. Follow manufacturer pinouts for wiring. Software checks and physical-device acceptance are documented separately.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="integration-section">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">API · MCP · CLI</p><h2>One function catalog.<br />Your choice of interface.</h2></div>
    <div><p>Connect an agent through MCP, call the HTTPS API from your application, or use <code>ol</code> in your terminal. Each discovers the functions its connection may use and returns action receipts.</p><nav class="links" aria-label="Interfaces"><a href="/docs/agents">Connect MCP →</a><a href="/docs/reference">Explore the API →</a><a href="/docs/cli">Install ol →</a></nav></div>
  </section>
  <section class="integration-section">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">BUILD YOUR OWN FUNCTIONS</p><h2>Your device.<br />Your functions.</h2></div>
    <div><p>Write a handler, describe its inputs and publish it from your adapter. Owner-approved functions appear as tools for connected agents. Use the JavaScript SDK, embedded ESP32 SDK or device HTTP protocol.</p><nav class="links" aria-label="Build resources"><a href="/docs/functions">Build a function →</a><a href="/docs/sdk">SDK quickstart →</a><a href="https://github.com/pkyanam/openlaunch">View the source ↗</a></nav></div>
  </section>
  <section class="closing"><h2>Start with one device.</h2><p>Pair it, grant one function and inspect the result.</p><a class="primary-link" href="/console/">Open your console <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="updates-link" href="/changelog">Latest updates →</a></section>
</main>
<Footer slot="footer" />
</PageLayout>
<style>
.workbench{--ink:#171717;--muted:#626262;--line:#dedede;--paper:#fff;max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:64px 40px 56px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);font-family:var(--font-sans,system-ui),sans-serif}.workbench *{box-sizing:border-box}.workbench a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px;font-size:13px;text-decoration:none}.workbench a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.workbench a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:5px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.4px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px}.workbench h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2.7px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 26px}.intro-copy{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 28px}.hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:18px 28px}.workbench a.primary-link{display:inline-flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:32px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);padding:13px 18px;min-height:46px;border:1px solid var(--ink);text-decoration:none}.primary-link:hover{opacity:.82}.intro-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:20px 0 0;line-height:1.8}.intro-note a{font-size:11px;margin-left:8px}.workflow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));border-block:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:52px}.workflow article{padding:28px 26px 28px 0}.workflow article+article{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:26px}.step{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:22px}.workflow h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.4px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 12px}.workflow p,.boards p,.integration-section p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.hardware-section{padding-top:48px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;margin-bottom:28px}.section-heading h2,.integration-section h2,.closing h2{font-size:29px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.9px;font-weight:500;margin:0}.section-heading .eyebrow,.integration-section .eyebrow{margin-bottom:16px}.section-heading>a{font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;margin-bottom:4px}.boards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:36px}.boards img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2;object-fit:contain;filter:grayscale(1)}.board-image{display:block;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;margin-bottom:22px;overflow:hidden}.boards h3{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.6px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 12px}.boards p{max-width:450px;margin-bottom:18px}.image-note{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:24px 0 0}.integration-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.55fr;gap:60px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:44px 0;margin-top:38px}.integration-section+.integration-section{margin-top:0}.links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px 24px;margin-top:22px}.workbench code{font-size:.95em}.closing{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:42px}.updates-link{display:inline-block;margin-left:24px}.closing p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;margin:12px 0 22px}:global(.dark) .workbench,:global([data-theme='dark']) .workbench{--ink:#eee;--muted:#aaa;--line:#3c3c3c;--paper:#111}:global(.dark) .board-image,:global([data-theme='dark']) .board-image{background:#eee}@media(max-width:850px){.workbench{padding:40px 24px}.workflow article{padding-right:18px}.workflow article+article{padding-left:18px}.integration-section{gap:30px}}@media(max-width:650px){.workbench h1{letter-spacing:-1.6px}.desktop-break{display:none}.workflow{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:36px}.workflow article,.workflow article+article{border-left:0;padding:22px 0}.workflow article+article{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.step{margin-bottom:12px}.section-heading{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:18px}.boards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.integration-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:22px;padding:32px 0}.section-heading h2,.integration-section h2,.closing h2{font-size:26px}.intro-copy{font-size:15px}}
</style>
